  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">• About our brand and products:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Koti — the Finnish word for home — embodies more than a place to live. It represents comfort, belonging, and self-expression. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">At Koti, we believe a home should be a mirror of the people who inhabit it: thoughtful, personal, and alive with meaning.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We aspire to be the preferred destination for a new generation of urban dwellers and design enthusiasts. For those building their first home, shaping a rental into something uniquely theirs, or simply seeking timeless pieces, Koti offers an edit that inspires independent and refined living.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>• What makes us different:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">At Koti, we not only design and manufactures our own products but we search for products across the globe from Korea, Japan, Taiwan and more that we believe will elevate your home. You will see designs that you won't find in the U.S, but unique items and selections globally. </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">For every sale through your discount code, you can earn 10% of the revenue through our program. </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>• How to promote us:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Feel free to tell your friends and family about Koti! Share it through your social media, follow us on instagram and share our posts to your loved ones. Make your own contents and let them know about Koti.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p></div></div>",
